{% comment %}
  Step 3 (shown as "Step 2 of 5") — doctor selection. Now reached from the
  new Concern Select step, not directly from Entry — see that step's own
  comment for why.

  Clinic + doctor list are now REAL, fetched from the CMS (2026-08 backend
  test): a facility strip (data-kal-facility-strip, 4 clinics — Indiranagar,
  Koramangala, JP Nagar, Ernakulam, picked because each one actually has real
  doctors assigned, confirmed live against GET /api/public/doctors before
  hardcoding them here) drives which facility's doctors get fetched from
  GET /api/public/doctors?facility_id=X. The doctor cards themselves
  (data-kal-doctor-list, one per breakpoint) are empty placeholders in this
  markup — kal-booking-flow.js's loadDoctorsForFacility() replaces their
  contents with real cards built from the API response (id + name only —
  that endpoint doesn't return specialization/photo/languages/tags yet, so
  the dynamic cards show name only, not the richer static mockup they
  replaced).

  In-clinic/video mode toggle no longer filters the doctor list (the old
  data-kal-modes attribute doesn't exist on API doctors — we have no
  per-doctor mode-availability data from the backend yet), it only still
  drives the price banner and the summary badge on later steps.
{% endcomment %}

<div class="kal-step-doctor-select">

  {%- comment -%} ============ MOBILE ONLY (below 750px) ============ {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="kal-step-doctor-select__mobile">

    <div class="kal-step-doctor-select__header">
      <button type="button" class="kal-step-doctor-select__back" data-kal-back="concern-select" aria-label="Back">
        {%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'chevron-left' -%}
      </button>
      <div class="kal-step-doctor-select__progress">
        <span class="kal-step-doctor-select__progress-dot"></span>
        <span class="kal-step-doctor-select__progress-dot kal-step-doctor-select__progress-dot--active"></span>
        <span class="kal-step-doctor-select__progress-dot"></span>
        <span class="kal-step-doctor-select__progress-dot"></span>
        <span class="kal-step-doctor-select__progress-dot"></span>
        <span class="kal-step-doctor-select__progress-text">2/5</span>
      </div>
      {%- comment -%}
        Own close button, matching Therapy Slot's pattern — a real flex
        sibling of back/progress in this same row, not the separate,
        absolutely-positioned .kal-booking-flow__close. That one is
        positioned independently (top:12px, fixed) from wherever this
        header row actually sits, so once the header got its own top
        padding, the two drifted out of alignment. kal-booking-flow.js
        hides the global close button whenever a step other than "entry"
        is active, since every step but Entry now has its own.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <button type="button" class="kal-step-doctor-select__back" data-kal-close aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
    </div>

    {%- comment -%}
      Wraps everything between the fixed header and fixed footer in its own
      scroll area — needed now that the redesigned doctor cards are tall
      enough to push total content past typical mobile viewport height. On
      mobile, #kal-booking-flow-content itself is the only scroll container
      (overflow-y:auto is never turned off below 750px, unlike desktop), so
      without this, the whole page — footer included — scrolled together,
      and the Continue button only appeared once you scrolled all the way
      down instead of staying pinned to the bottom of the frame.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="kal-step-doctor-select__scroll">
      <div class="kal-step-doctor-select__intro">
        <p class="kal-step-doctor-select__eyebrow">Step 2 of 5</p>
        <h2 class="kal-step-doctor-select__heading">Who would you like to see?</h2>
        <p class="kal-step-doctor-select__subtext">Choose a doctor or browse by specialty.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="kal-slot-section__head">
        <p class="kal-slot-section__label">Choose a clinic</p>
      </div>
      {%- comment -%} Populated statically below (4 real, hand-picked facilities — see the top comment for why). Selecting one re-fetches the doctor list via loadDoctorsForFacility() in kal-booking-flow.js. {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="kal-facility-strip" data-kal-facility-strip>
        <button type="button" class="kal-facility-chip kal-facility-chip--active" data-kal-facility="bfa7bd70-428b-4fd3-80c3-2c7f0106497d" data-kal-facility-name="Indiranagar">Indiranagar</button>
        <button type="button" class="kal-facility-chip" data-kal-facility="185b85d7-fad2-405d-b8ea-13dc683fbde8" data-kal-facility-name="Koramangala">Koramangala</button>
        <button type="button" class="kal-facility-chip" data-kal-facility="6cb82314-692b-44ad-87e1-86e147bc107d" data-kal-facility-name="JP Nagar">JP Nagar</button>
        <button type="button" class="kal-facility-chip" data-kal-facility="98d24182-c035-425d-9284-56c59cc05056" data-kal-facility-name="Ernakulam">Ernakulam</button>
      </div>

      <div class="kal-toggle-group">
        <button type="button" class="kal-toggle-btn" data-kal-mode="in-clinic">
          <span class="kal-icon kal-icon--location">
            {%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'location-pin' -%}
          </span>
          In-clinic
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="kal-toggle-btn kal-toggle-btn--active" data-kal-mode="video">
          <span class="kal-icon kal-icon--video">
            {%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'video-camera' -%}
          </span>
          Video consult
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="kal-step-doctor-select__list" data-kal-doctor-list>
        <p class="kal-doctor-list__loading">Loading doctors&hellip;</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="kal-step-doctor-select__footer">
      {%- render 'kal-booking-flow-price-banner' -%}
      <button type="button" class="kal-step-doctor-select__continue" data-kal-goto="slot-picker" data-kal-doctor-continue disabled>
        Select a doctor
      </button>
    </div>

  </div>

  {%- comment -%}
    ============ DESKTOP (750px and up) ============
    Left column reuses the exact same structure/copy as the Entry step's
    desktop left column (per the Figma spec — only the heading text differs).
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="kal-step-doctor-select__desktop">
    <div class="kal-step-entry__info">
      <div class="kal-step-entry__info-content">
        <h2 class="kal-step-entry__heading">Who would you like to see?</h2>
        <p class="kal-step-entry__body-text">
          Book a consultation in under a minute in-clinic or video. Confirmation
          arrives instantly, no account required.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="kal-step-entry__location">
        <span class="kal-icon kal-icon--location">
          <!-- ICON: location-pin (not received yet) -->
        </span>
        <span class="kal-step-entry__location-text">
          Kerala Ayurveda Wellness Center, Indiranagar &middot; Opens 8 AM
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="kal-step-doctor-select__panel">
      <div class="kal-step-doctor-select__progress kal-step-doctor-select__progress--desktop">
        <span class="kal-step-doctor-select__progress-dot"></span>
        <span class="kal-step-doctor-select__progress-dot kal-step-doctor-select__progress-dot--active"></span>
        <span class="kal-step-doctor-select__progress-dot"></span>
        <span class="kal-step-doctor-select__progress-dot"></span>
        <span class="kal-step-doctor-select__progress-dot"></span>
        <span class="kal-step-doctor-select__progress-text">2/5</span>
      </div>

      <div class="kal-slot-section__head">
        <p class="kal-slot-section__label">Choose a clinic</p>
      </div>
      <div class="kal-facility-strip" data-kal-facility-strip>
        <button type="button" class="kal-facility-chip kal-facility-chip--active" data-kal-facility="bfa7bd70-428b-4fd3-80c3-2c7f0106497d" data-kal-facility-name="Indiranagar">Indiranagar</button>
        <button type="button" class="kal-facility-chip" data-kal-facility="185b85d7-fad2-405d-b8ea-13dc683fbde8" data-kal-facility-name="Koramangala">Koramangala</button>
        <button type="button" class="kal-facility-chip" data-kal-facility="6cb82314-692b-44ad-87e1-86e147bc107d" data-kal-facility-name="JP Nagar">JP Nagar</button>
        <button type="button" class="kal-facility-chip" data-kal-facility="98d24182-c035-425d-9284-56c59cc05056" data-kal-facility-name="Ernakulam">Ernakulam</button>
      </div>

      <div class="kal-toggle-group">
        <button type="button" class="kal-toggle-btn" data-kal-mode="in-clinic">
          <span class="kal-icon kal-icon--location">
            {%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'location-pin' -%}
          </span>
          In-clinic
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="kal-toggle-btn kal-toggle-btn--active" data-kal-mode="video">
          <span class="kal-icon kal-icon--video">
            {%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'video-camera' -%}
          </span>
          Video consult
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="kal-step-doctor-select__list kal-step-doctor-select__list--desktop" data-kal-doctor-list>
        <p class="kal-doctor-list__loading">Loading doctors&hellip;</p>
      </div>

      <div class="kal-step-doctor-select__desktop-footer">
        {%- render 'kal-booking-flow-price-banner' -%}
        <button type="button" class="kal-step-doctor-select__continue" data-kal-goto="slot-picker" data-kal-doctor-continue disabled>
          Select a doctor
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>
